9.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending the Official Zoning Map of the City of
Cheyenne changing the zoning classification from MR Medium-Density Residential to
MUB Mixed-Use Business Emphasis for land located at Lot 29, Block 1, Eastridge.

ACTION:

10.
ORDINANCE –3rd READING – Amending the Major Street Plan Official Map 2017, by
updating the entire Major Street Plan Official Map with newly platted and built roads and
with the most recent Master Transportation Plan (Connect 2045) and other recently adopted
Master Transportation Amendments.

ACTION:

12.
ORDINANCE –2nd READING – Creating Chapter 2.96, Ethical Obligations of Public
Officials, Public Members and City Employees, of Title 2, Administration and Personnel,
of the Municipal Code of the City of Cheyenne, Wyoming, specifying the ethical duties
and obligations of Public Officials, Public Members and Employees of the City of
Cheyenne.  (SPONSOR – DR. ALDRICH)

ACTION:
